{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S05、S11、S13等段落的长句不够利于快速扫读，音乐细节的逐拍呈现也不如X细致。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更适合没读过原文的普通观众，因为它把人物每一步的心理动机、犹豫和转折交代得更完整，尤其S05到S07、S10到S13，能看懂他为什么从害怕暴露喜欢，逐渐走向愿意付出，却又害怕失去。X的重点词醒目，感受词也更丰富，并且有些细微音乐变化与文字出现的时机结合得很好；但短语堆叠和连续比喻较多，部分段落容易只留下丰富的意象，却不容易看清人物行动背后的原因。综合而言，Y建立起来的情感故事更完整，作为第一次观看的观众，我更容易真正理解并跟上这个人。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "53f24a75-c6da-4cf8-9b75-a0c1234b3cef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T220447604845Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:06:07.867272+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d86c4eb55592e06f104d6a3ae99a8d6bf704e8619f5202b2316aa26e8c5248cf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb